    "claims": [
      {
        "claim": "To be honest, the changes in Uptown have me feeling a bit uneasy. The streets are busier than ever, and it seems like every other place is a for-rent sign these days. I've lived here long enough to see the neighborhood transform, but this feels different. It's like the neighborhood is shifting away from the people who've been here all along. I put on my good suit for Sunday service because some traditions still matter, but walking around, I see more strangers than familiar faces. It's hard not to wonder if this is still my neighborhood or if I'm just a ghost walking through someone else's plans.",
